{"dish/bombay-potato":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/bombay-potato","n":"Bombay potato","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from Indian cuisine","dot":"#f0b340","intro":[["Bombay potato (sometimes called Bombay potatoes, Bombay aloo or aloo (alu) Bombay) is an Indian dish prepared using potatoes that are cubed, parboiled and then fried and seasoned with various spices such as cumin, curry, garlic, garam masala, turmeric, mustard seeds, chili powder, salt and pepper. Onion, tomatoes and tomato sauce are sometimes used as ingredients. Bombay potato can also be served as a side dish, rather than as a main course."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-bombay-potato"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bombay_potato"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Indian cuisine","cuisine/indian-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":1,"links":[["Potato","ingredient/potato"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Swasthi's Recipes","ref":"site/indianhealthyrecipes-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"indianhealthyrecipes.com","note":"Swasthi Shreekanth's long-running blog of everyday Indian home cooking from across the regions.","url":"https://www.indianhealthyrecipes.com/about/","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"},{"name":"Hari Ghotra","ref":"site/harighotra-co-uk","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"harighotra.co.uk","note":"UK-based cook Hari Ghotra's recipe library and videos of home-style Indian dishes.","url":"https://www.harighotra.co.uk/indian-recipes","suggested":true,"kind":"site"}]},{"h":"More from Indian cuisine","links":[["Akuri","dish/akuri"],["Aloo paratha","dish/aloo-paratha"],["Amba (condiment)","dish/amba-condiment"],["Baingan bharta","dish/baingan-bharta"],["Butter chicken","dish/butter-chicken"],["Chaat masala","dish/chaat-masala"],["Chicken Chettinad","dish/chicken-chettinad"],["Dahi vada","dish/dahi-vada"],["Dal dhokli","dish/dal-dhokli"],["Dal makhani","dish/dal-makhani"],["Fafda","dish/fafda"],